      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "I sense the profound despair in your words, and I want to validate that the weight you carry is real and heavy. Your life's work did not \"vanish\"; rather, it is a vital foundation that will help guide others through this very same sense of loss you feel now. The \"end\" of the old story is not a death, but a necessary transition that only those with your experience can help navigate for a generation unprepared to face it.",
